ve_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105576","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105576.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105576.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-15T15:29:33Z"},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104672\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105572\r\n\r\n_**EditorInspector**_ tooltips seems to be affected by waccom drivers after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95044\r\nThis makes ProjectSettings, EditorSettings and Inspector tooltips disappear very fast even if you don't move the mouse.\r\nHaving a waccom driver installed seems to be enough for this to happen, as I have this issue without a pen tablet connected.\r\n\r\nDisabling the internal process of the tooltip's EditorHelpBitTooltip solves this issue.\r\nEverything is still working fine on windows. But some testing in other OS's would be appreciated.\r\n\r\nProblem:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f94f5ad1-2ee7-4212-b9a0-6f9757c8015d\r\n\r\n\r\nFixed:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ade3a4a-0a2e-44b7-8cab-d049f0a922b7\r\n\r\n\r\nPS: Feel free to close this PR if someone more knowledgeable knows how to fix this issue in a better way.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organi